`]}),e.jsxs(r,{title:"What the objective does not settle",children:[e.jsx(t.p,{children:"Most questions about next-token prediction have a week in this course. Which data a model should learn from is the topic of Week 9, data curation. Which model predicts well is the subject of Weeks 2 to 5, which build and optimize the Transformer, and of Week 13, on mixture-of-experts models. Using the hardware well runs through Weeks 4 to 6, and serving a model efficiently is Week 10. Measuring a model is the topic of Week 7. Shaping a model's behavior after pretraining is post-training, in Weeks 11 and 12. A question that no week answers is a good starting point for a final project."}),e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Some questions the objective itself leaves open. Next-token loss rewards the regularities that help predict the realized sequence. Models trained on it often learn useful contextual representations, because many patterns in text improve prediction. The negative log-likelihood that the loss measures is linked to the length of an ideal code for the text, so a better predictor is also a better compressor ",e.jsx(n,{id:"deletang2024",children:"Delétang et al., 2024"}),". Whether a good compressor also understands what it predicts is a separate question that this link cannot answer. The objective guarantees neither grounding nor reliable reasoning."]}),e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Kaplan et al. found that aggregate language-model loss falls predictably as compute, data and parameters grow ",e.jsx(n,{id:"kaplan2020",children:"Kaplan et al., 2020"}),". Schaeffer et al. showed that evaluation choices can change the conclusions drawn about capabilities ",e.jsx(n,{id:"schaeffer2023",children:"Schaeffer et al., 2023"}),". Benchmark behavior also depends on the prompt, the metric and variance, so scaling and capability claims are empirical and tied to their setup, and the objective alone does not settle them. To judge one, inspect what is measured, how the score is built and what is held fixed. The Transformer you build from Week 2 on optimizes this objective, so these limits apply to it."]})]})]})]}),`
